.TP
.B \-clean\-out VALUE
write a separate normalized dataset here; never overwrites the input (default: )
.TP
.B \-previous VALUE
optional previous public permit snapshot for comparison (default: )
.TP
.B \-json VALUE
emit the report as JSON (default: false)
.TP
